<mxfile><diagram name="Agent node controls"><mxGraphModel><root><mxCell id="0" /><mxCell id="1" parent="0" /><mxCell id="main" value="Agent node - main controls&#10;Task input&#10;Operation&#10;Model: runner-discovered dropdown&#10;Reasoning Effort: model-specific dropdown&#10;Skill References input (below Reasoning Effort)&#10;Answer / Run Reference / Submission outputs" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#eff6ff;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="40" width="440" height="240" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="advanced" value="Advanced controls - collapsed by default&#10;Expand inside node with click or keyboard&#10;Preserve values; no graph execution on toggle" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="300" width="440" height="110" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="expanded" value="Advanced controls - expanded state&#10;Output Continuation Retries&#10;HTTP Timeout&#10;Runner URL&#10;Only advanced scalar controls; wired controls stay outside&#10;Respect Inspector promotion to main form&#10;Update node handle geometry on toggle/minimize" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f8fafc;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="40" width="460" height="245" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="internal" value="Internal compatibility fields - not rendered&#10;Request ID and inline Skill IDs&#10;Output Requirements and its JSON alternative&#10;Prior Run and Prior Run JSON&#10;Join Bridge URL: backend configuration" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff7ed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="310" width="460" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="compatibility" value="Legacy connection limitation&#10;Hidden ports remain hidden in old saved schemas too.&#10;Backend values are retained. Visible-handle and&#10;editing/save migration remain unverified." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#fff7ed;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="440" width="440" height="150" as="geometry" /></mxCell><mxCell id="behavior" value="Execution and ownership&#10;Request identity is automatic.&#10;Skills and revisions are configured on Skill nodes.&#10;Codex bridge applies only to fresh/start; lifecycle&#10;operations and OpenCode use their runner directly." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=0;fillColor=#f0fdf4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="540" y="530" width="460" height="170" as="geometry" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
